# Figures are build output, not records. Everything they are drawn from is kept
# (metrics.csv and friends per run, the aggregated JSONs in analysis/, the
# stance parquets), and analysis/REGENERATING_FIGURES.md has the command for
# every one of them.
#
# The paper set is the exception: it is the deliverable, so it stays tracked.
# Excluding the directory's entries and then re-including official_paper lets
# git descend into it again.
analysis/figures/*
!analysis/figures/official_paper/
!analysis/figures/DELETED_MANIFEST.txt

# The superseded second figure root. The leading slash matters: a bare
# "figures/" would also match analysis/figures/ and swallow the paper set.
/figures/
